#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.4.rst:4
msgid "v4.0.4"
msgstr "v4.0.4"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.4.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.0.4 is a maintenance release that refreshes the bundled OpenMV firmware "
"to 4.4.3, improves error reporting during camera registration, and updates "
"the RT1060 flash loader. It is based on Qt Creator 10.0.1, and there are no "
"breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"v4.0.4 est une version de maintenance qui actualise le micrologiciel OpenMV "
"fourni vers la version 4.4.3, améliore les rapports d'erreur lors de "
"l'enregistrement de la caméra et met à jour le chargeur de mémoire flash "
"RT1060. Elle est basée sur Qt Creator 10.0.1, et il n'y a aucun changement "
"incompatible."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.4.rst:14
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Sur cette page"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.4.rst:17
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Points forts"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.4.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Bundled firmware updated to 4.4.3** for all OpenMV Cam boards and the "
"supported Arduino targets."
msgstr ""
"**Micrologiciel fourni mis à jour vers 4.4.3** pour toutes les cartes OpenMV"
" Cam et les cibles Arduino prises en charge."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.4.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Clearer camera-registration errors** now surface explicit dialogs when the"
" ``form_key`` registration flow fails instead of failing silently."
msgstr ""
"**Erreurs d'enregistrement de la caméra plus claires** : des boîtes de "
"dialogue explicites apparaissent désormais lorsque le flux d'enregistrement "
"``form_key`` échoue, au lieu d'un échec silencieux."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.4.rst:23
msgid "**Updated RT1060 flash loader** for the OpenMV RT1060 board."
msgstr ""
"**Chargeur de mémoire flash RT1060 mis à jour** pour la carte OpenMV RT1060."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.4.rst:26
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Autres changements et améliorations"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.4.rst:28
msgid ""
"Updated the bundled bootloader/flash-loader binary for the **OpenMV RT1060**"
" board (`cfa6b2cd1 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/cfa6b2cd1>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Mise à jour du binaire de programme d'amorçage/chargeur de mémoire flash "
"fourni pour la carte **OpenMV RT1060** (`cfa6b2cd1 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/cfa6b2cd1>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.4.rst:33
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Corrections de bogues"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.4.rst:35
msgid ""
"When the camera-registration ``form_key`` option is set, connecting now "
"surfaces explicit error dialogs (Database Error, network/GET errors, or a "
"non-affirmative server response) instead of silently failing (`c3f1f46e6 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c3f1f46e6>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque l'option ``form_key`` d'enregistrement de la caméra est définie, la "
"connexion fait désormais apparaître des boîtes de dialogue d'erreur "
"explicites (Erreur de base de données, erreurs réseau/GET, ou une réponse "
"non affirmative du serveur) au lieu d'échouer silencieusement (`c3f1f46e6 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c3f1f46e6>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.4.rst:41
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Prise en charge des plateformes et des outils"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.4.rst:43
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 10.0.1."
msgstr "**Base Qt Creator :** 10.0.1."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.4.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Bundled OpenMV firmware:** updated to **4.4.3** for all OpenMV Cam boards "
"(OPENMV2/3/4/4P/PT and RT1060) and the Arduino Nano RP2040 Connect, Nicla "
"Vision, Portenta H7, and Nano 33 BLE Sense (`8195c94b0 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8195c94b0>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Micrologiciel OpenMV fourni :** mis à jour vers la version **4.4.3** pour "
"toutes les cartes OpenMV Cam (OPENMV2/3/4/4P/PT et RT1060) ainsi que pour "
"les Arduino Nano RP2040 Connect, Nicla Vision, Portenta H7 et Nano 33 BLE "
"Sense (`8195c94b0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/8195c94b0>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.4.rst:50
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Changements incompatibles"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.4.rst:52
msgid "None. Existing projects and workflows continue to work unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Aucun. Les projets et les flux de travail existants continuent de "
"fonctionner sans modification."
